CDE backdrops

These pattern files are the unmodified backdrops of the Common Desktop Environment,
taken from cde/programs/backdrops of the CDE project
(https://sourceforge.net/projects/cdesktopenv/, mirror https://github.com/cdesktopenv/cde,
git commit d35c607e3a722201c6cd3213491a9483d40ef13e).

